@host = https://localhost:55076

### 1. Start et øvesæt (noter attemptId fra svaret)
POST {{host}}/api/exercise-sets/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": 1,
  "topicId": 1
}

### 2. Afslut forsøget — forventet 204
POST {{host}}/api/exercise-sets/complete
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "attemptId": 1
}

### 3. Afslut samme forsøg igen — forventet 400
POST {{host}}/api/exercise-sets/complete
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "attemptId": 1
}

### 4. Forsøg der ikke findes — forventet 404
POST {{host}}/api/exercise-sets/complete
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "attemptId": 99999
}

### 5. Ugyldigt input — forventet 400 fra validatoren
POST {{host}}/api/exercise-sets/complete
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "attemptId": 0
}

### 6. Start igen på samme emne — forventet et ANDET øvesæt
POST {{host}}/api/exercise-sets/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": 1,
  "topicId": 1
}


### 7. Besvar en øvelse korrekt — forventet 204
POST {{host}}/api/exercise-sets/answer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "attemptId": 1,
  "exerciseId": 1,
  "answer": "1,5"
}

### 8. Samme tal med ekstra nul — forventet korrekt
POST {{host}}/api/exercise-sets/answer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "attemptId": 1,
  "exerciseId": 1,
  "answer": "1,50"
}

### 9. Mellemrum omkring — forventet korrekt
POST {{host}}/api/exercise-sets/answer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "attemptId": 1,
  "exerciseId": 1,
  "answer": "  1,5  "
}

### 10. Punktum — forventet 400 med besked om komma
POST {{host}}/api/exercise-sets/answer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "attemptId": 1,
  "exerciseId": 1,
  "answer": "1.5"
}

### 11. Forkert svar — forventet gemt med IsCorrect = false
POST {{host}}/api/exercise-sets/answer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "attemptId": 1,
  "exerciseId": 1,
  "answer": "1,6"
}

### 12. Ikke et tal — forventet 400
POST {{host}}/api/exercise-sets/answer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "attemptId": 1,
  "exerciseId": 1,
  "answer": "to en halv"
}